── SYNTAX ERROR ──────────────────── E0100_single_quoted_string.lt:1:24  [E0100]

Stilt writes a string in double quotes, as "hello":

  1 │ fn greeting() -> str { 'hello' }
    │                        ^

A string holds any text, one character or more, and is written in `"`.

To fix it, write it in double quotes:

  1 │ fn greeting() -> str { "hello" }
    │                        ~     ~
